    "detailed_description": "In \u201cEscape the Forest,\u201d you choose your path to uncover the mystery behind your neighbors\u2019 sudden disappearance.<br><br>Nestled in a remote forest, you and your neighbors have lived in peace. However, recent nights have brought strange feelings and a sense of lurking danger.<br><br><br><strong>Current Features</strong><br><br>Discover the truth behind your neighbor\u2019s disappearance in this immersive single-player story.<br><br>This arena shooter features designated safe houses where you can rearm using your neighbor\u2019s armory.<br><br>Beware of various wildlife that pose a threat as you wander from house to house searching for clues.<br><br>Weapons come with different ammo types:<br>           Stun - This ammo type temporarily stops the enemies' movements.<br>             Fire - Set your enemies ablaze which deals damage over time.<br><br>Multiplayer- having a blast playing with your friends!<br><br><strong>Planned Features</strong><br><br><br>A dynamic weather system affects gameplay visibility and gunplay.<br><br>NPCs - provide interaction opportunities, allowing you to purchase gear and weapons from your neighbors.",
